('sarah','Sarah','genesis','Woman whose trust in the promise is recalled within the examples of faith','The writer connects her promised child with confidence in the one who promised.','Her example joins waiting and received power within the repeated account of faith.',[11]),
('rahab','Rahab','joshua','Woman whose reception of the spies is recalled as an act of faith','The writer contrasts her rescue with the destruction of those who refused.','Her brief example widens the account of faith beyond the ancestors of Israel.',[11]),
